---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Mast from './Mast.astro';
import { getPlays } from '../lib/plays';
import { t, localePath, otherLocale, type Locale } from '../lib/i18n';

interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}

const { locale } = Astro.props;
const isX = (u?: string) => /^https?:\/\/(www\.)?(x|twitter)\.com\//i.test(u || '');
const enPlays = await getPlays('en');
const zhPlays = await getPlays('zh');
const enX = enPlays.filter((p) => isX(p.sourceUrl)).length;
---
<Base
  title={t(locale, 'page.aboutTitle')}
  description={t(locale, 'page.aboutDesc')}
  nav="about"
  locale={locale}
  switchHref={localePath(otherLocale(locale), '/about')}
  alternates={{ en: '/about/', zh: '/zh/about/' }}
>
  <Mast locale={locale} compact heading={false} />
  <h1 class="discover-h1">{locale === 'zh' ? '关于 Grok Bot Plays' : 'About Grok Bot Plays'}</h1>

  {locale === 'zh' ? (
    <article class="about">
      <section class="about-block">
        <h2>这是什么</h2>
        <p>这是非官方、编辑向的 Grok Bot 玩法导航，不是 prompt 货架，也不卖模板。</p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-block">
        <h2>收录</h2>
        <p>每条必须有可点开的真实来源：公开帖或官方说明。没有来源的不写。现有英文 {enPlays.length} 条、中文 {zhPlays.length} 条。来源不全是 X：英文里 {enX} 条链到 X 帖子，其余链到 GitHub、LinkedIn、YouTube、x.ai 或博客等。</p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-block">
        <h2>数字</h2>
        <p>不编造点赞、阅读或后台统计。卡片上不会出现这些数字。</p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-block">
        <h2>关系</h2>
        <p>本站与 xAI / Grok 无关。</p>
      </section>
    </article>
  ) : (
    <article class="about">
      <section class="about-block">
        <h2>What this is</h2>
        <p>An unofficial, edited catalog of Grok Bot plays. Not a prompt shop. Nothing for sale.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-block">
        <h2>What’s here</h2>
        <p>Every play needs a real, clickable source — a public post or official docs. No source, no entry. There are {enPlays.length} English plays and {zhPlays.length} Chinese plays. Sources aren’t all X: {enX} English plays link to an X post; the rest link to GitHub, LinkedIn, YouTube, x.ai, a blog, or similar.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-block">
        <h2>Numbers</h2>
        <p>We don’t invent likes, views, or dashboard stats. Cards don’t show those.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="about-block">
        <h2>Affiliation</h2>
        <p>This site is not affiliated with xAI or Grok.</p>
      </section>
    </article>
  )}
</Base>
